 "notes": [
  "Total 60 as published (header counts match). The list opens with the title 'Dangerous Times' repeated; it is not a card (the draft had matched it to the Interrupt A Dangerous Time).",
  "Endor: Bunker and Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay) are marked '(SL)' with the Objective. The strategy pulls Ominous Rumors on the first turn and starts Security Precautions only against Hidden Base, so no starting Effect is set.",
  "Posted 'DV,DLoTS' dested Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; 'Dreadnaught' Dreadnaught-Class Heavy Cruiser; 'Obsidian Tie'/'Black Squadron Tie' Obsidian Squadron TIE / Black Squadron TIE; 'Tempest Scout' the generic Endor vehicle; 'Perimiter Patrol' Perimeter Patrol; 'Twi'lek Advisor (x1) (SI)' the Special Edition Twi'lek Advisor. The 'Sites (14)' header covers two Endor sites and twelve systems.",
  "Thunderflare in October 1999 is the Second Anthology preview starship (Death Star II came out in 2000)."
 ]
